WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:09.324
The next day more woodcutters entered the forest.

2
00:00:09.325 --> 00:00:12.500
A chill went up Beauty's spine.

3
00:00:12.501 --> 00:00:16.723
"Why are there so many of them?" she thought.

4
00:00:16.724 --> 00:00:21.235
"Excuse me," Beauty called to one man.

5
00:00:21.236 --> 00:00:24.467
"Is everyone going to cut wood?"

6
00:00:24.468 --> 00:00:31.718
He just shook his head and hurried off.

7
00:00:31.719 --> 00:00:35.774
Beauty asked another man, then another.

8
00:00:35.775 --> 00:00:39.347
No one would tell her what they were doing.

9
00:00:39.348 --> 00:00:45.369
Finally she spotted a young boy.

10
00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:48.536
"Please tell me," she said.

11
00:00:48.537 --> 00:00:51.951
"What are all the men doing in the forest?"

12
00:00:51.952 --> 00:00:57.279
The boy grinned. "We're cutting it down!"

13
00:00:57.280 --> 00:01:01.627
Beauty gasped. "Why?"

14
00:01:01.628 --> 00:01:04.725
"The monster," the boy said.

15
00:01:04.726 --> 00:01:08.656
"We have to kill the monster who lives there."

16
00:01:08.657 --> 00:01:14.060
Beauty turned pale. "No, you don't understand!

17
00:01:14.061 --> 00:01:17.676
There is no monster in the forest."

18
00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:20.881
A man heard her.

19
00:01:20.882 --> 00:01:25.317
"I saw that beast with my own eyes," he said.

20
00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:28.200
"We wounded it, but it got away.

21
00:01:28.201 --> 00:01:31.795
Now we're going to chop down the forest.

22
00:01:31.796 --> 00:01:35.824
We'll find the beast—and kill it!"

23
00:01:35.825 --> 00:01:40.254
The men stomped off into the forest.

24
00:01:40.255 --> 00:01:43.571
Beauty wrung her hands.

25
00:01:43.572 --> 00:01:50.858
"Beast was scary, it's true," she thought.

26
00:01:50.859 --> 00:01:57.828
"But he did let me go free."

27
00:01:57.829 --> 00:02:00.896
Beauty thought for another second.

28
00:02:00.897 --> 00:02:05.188
"I must warn him!" she thought.

29
00:02:05.189 --> 00:02:12.194
"But what will I tell Father?"

30
00:02:12.195 --> 00:02:20.996
Finally she left a note.

31
00:02:20.997 --> 00:02:23.391
Dear Father,

32
00:02:23.392 --> 00:02:25.630
I went to help a friend.

33
00:02:25.631 --> 00:02:27.815
I will be back soon.

34
00:02:27.816 --> 00:02:31.406
Please, don't try to follow me.

35
00:02:31.407 --> 00:02:32.468
Love,

36
00:02:32.469 --> 00:02:34.160
Beauty

37
00:02:34.161 --> 00:02:38.463
Beauty darted into the forest.

38
00:02:38.464 --> 00:02:41.728
Crack! Clash!

39
00:02:41.729 --> 00:02:45.938
The air was filled with the sound of falling trees.

40
00:02:45.939 --> 00:02:50.146
Men shouted to each other. "Clear the forest!

41
00:02:50.147 --> 00:02:53.113
Find the beast!"

42
00:02:53.114 --> 00:02:55.920
Beauty ducked and hid.

43
00:02:55.921 --> 00:02:58.769
She didn't want the men to see her.

44
00:02:58.770 --> 00:03:03.953
No one could follow her to Beast's castle.

